# Remote backend deploy reminder

Ararix / cafe5 PHP API for development is hosted at **development.picassocloud.com**.

Whenever you change files under `web.picassoapp/` (especially `engine/v2/`, `engine/db/`, `engine/cnf.php`), at the end of the reply include a short block:

**Deploy to development.picassocloud.com**
- list changed relative paths
- note if DB migration / SQL must be run (`engine/db/*.sql`, `run_update.php`)
- note if `cnf.php` credentials differ on remote (do not overwrite remote secrets blindly)

Do this even for small PHP fixes. Flutter-only changes in `ararix/` do not need this block unless the API contract changed and backend was updated too.
